				of preserving rhythm in composition</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. de
				Or. 3, 49, 190</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Quint. 9, 4, 68</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">melo favente rhythmico,</span>”
